        "TileImage": "$($repository 35494743-6b3e-4ba2-8193-7a543a52bbf8).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47\r\rThe client is former Quantum Leap CEO, Jason Portman\rDuring his stay at Haven, Portman alleges that a previous MuchTalk client made an attempt on his life, poisoning the ice in his cocktails. Fortunately for him, poor ice pick technique kept the poison within the cube. \rThe ICA has been contracted to remove the cocktail waiters responsible.\r\rWith the MuchTalk scandal still fresh, the client cannot afford any heat falling back on them, so keep a low profile.\r\rHappy hunting",
